			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"丝柯克"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 150365001,
					"content": "他的身上一定有关于师父的线索。下次见面…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150365002,
						150365005,
						150365008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丝柯克"
				},
				{
					"id": 150365002,
					"content": "伤口还疼吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150365003
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150365003,
					"content": "外伤而已，不必在意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150365004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丝柯克"
				},
				{
					"id": 150365004,
					"content": "虽然恢复力量需要时间，但这种程度的困境我已经「适应」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "丝柯克"
				},
				{
					"id": 150365005,
					"content": "你的衣服…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150365006
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150365006,
					"content": "你说这个？提瓦特的深渊能量非常稀薄，为了更加自由地使用力量，我制作了一种「星晶旅装」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150365007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "丝柯克"
				},
				{
					"id": 150365007,
					"content": "里面蕴藏着高规格的深渊能量，可以为我的行动提供便利。能量散尽的时候，就会变回它最初的样子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "丝柯克"
				},
				{
					"id": 150365008,
					"content": "走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						150365009
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 150365009,
					"content": "找好休息的地方了吗？那就尽快离开这里吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "丝柯克"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1503651,
			"completionStepIds": [],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_OR",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1503609",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1503609,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					},
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1503606",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1503606,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
